<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="b3344fdc">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Have all attributes been defined?&lt;/strong&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Is reponsibility for updating attributes defined?&lt;/strong&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Is there a single source of truth for attributes?&lt;/strong&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;Has the team captured, or considered the following?&lt;/strong&gt; 
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Date the requirement was created
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Current version number (or other ID format) of the requirement
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Author who wrote the requirement
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Priority
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Status
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Origin or source of the requirement
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Rationale behind the requirement
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Release number or iteration to which the requirement is allocated
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Stakeholder to contact with questions or to make decisions about proposed changes
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                Validation method to be used or acceptance criteria
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
